### Blockchain Tokenizer API Examples
### Use this file with REST Client extension in VSCode or IntelliJ HTTP Client

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@testAddress = 0x742d35Cc6634C0532925a3b844Bc9e7595f0bEb
@recipientAddress = 0x5aAeb6053F3E94C9b9A09f33669435E7Ef1BeAed

### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### 2. Get Nonce for Address
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/nonce/{{testAddress}}

### 3. Get Current Gas Price
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/gas-price

### 4. Estimate Gas for Simple Transfer
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/estimate-gas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "{{testAddress}}",
  "to": "{{recipientAddress}}",
  "value": "1000000000000000000"
}

### 5. Create Simple ETH Transfer Transaction
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "{{testAddress}}",
  "to": "{{recipientAddress}}",
  "value": "1000000000000000000",
  "metadata": "Test transfer - 1 ETH"
}

### 6. Create Transaction with Contract Call
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "{{testAddress}}",
  "to": "0x6B175474E89094C44Da98b954EedeAC495271d0F",
  "value": "0",
  "data": "0x70a08231000000000000000000000000742d35cc6634c0532925a3b844bc9e7595f0beb",
  "gasLimit": "50000",
  "metadata": "DAI balanceOf call"
}

### 7. Deploy Simple Contract
POST {{baseUrl}}/contracts/deploy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "{{testAddress}}",
  "bytecode": "",
  "value": "0",
  "metadata": "Simple storage contract deployment"
}

### 8. Calculate Future Contract Address
GET {{baseUrl}}/contracts/calculate-address?deployerAddress={{testAddress}}&nonce=5

### 9. Create Transaction with Custom Gas Parameters
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "{{testAddress}}",
  "to": "{{recipientAddress}}",
  "value": "500000000000000000",
  "gasLimit": "21000",
  "maxPriorityFeePerGas": "2000000000",
  "maxFeePerGas": "50000000000",
  "metadata": "Transfer with custom gas"
}

### 10. Prometheus Metrics
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/prometheus

### 11. Application Info
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/info
